		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b57229d e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="b57229d" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-02fc91c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="02fc91c" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">How Much Do Sofa Cleaning Services Cost in Islamabad?</h2>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2f38e91 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="2f38e91" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p data-start="52" data-end="368">Sofa cleaning in islamabad and rawalpindi costs between 300-400 per seat for standard fabric type. . A full 5-seater sofa set usually costs around PKR 1,500–2,500, while specialized cleaning for L-shaped or leather sofas can range from PKR 2,000–4,000+ depending on the provider. </p><p data-start="52" data-end="368">The sofa cleaning cost in Islamabad usually depends on the size of the sofa, the material, and the level of stains or dirt that needs to be removed. On average, sofa cleaning prices for a standard sofa set cleaning service range between PKR 1,500 and PKR 4,000 for most homes.</p><ol><li class="dF3vjf" data-sfc-cb="" data-hveid="CAIQAA" data-processed="true"><span class="T286Pc" data-sfc-cp="" data-sfc-cb="" data-processed="true"><strong class="Yjhzub" data-sfc-cb="" data-processed="true">Standard Sofa Cleaning:</strong> PKR 300–400 per seat (PKR 900-1200 for 3-seater).</span></li><li class="dF3vjf" data-sfc-cb="" data-hveid="CAIQAQ" data-processed="true"><span class="T286Pc" data-sfc-cp="" data-sfc-cb="" data-processed="true"><strong class="Yjhzub" data-sfc-cb="" data-processed="true">5-Seater Set:</strong> PKR 1,500–2,500.</span></li><li class="dF3vjf" data-sfc-cb="" data-hveid="CAIQAg" data-processed="true"><span class="T286Pc" data-sfc-cp="" data-sfc-cb="" data-processed="true"><strong class="Yjhzub" data-sfc-cb="" data-processed="true">L-Shaped/Sectional:</strong> PKR 2,000–4,000+.</span></li><li class="dF3vjf" data-sfc-cb="" data-hveid="CAIQAw" data-processed="true"><span class="T286Pc" data-sfc-cp="" data-sfc-cb="" data-processed="true"><strong class="Yjhzub" data-sfc-cb="" data-processed="true">Leather/Premium:</strong> PKR 2,000–3,000+.</span></li></ol><p>At Mighty Twins Enterprises, we provide affordable sofa cleaning services in Islamabad and Rawalpindi with transparent pricing and no hidden charges. Our team offers professional sofa deep cleaning at home using modern sofa cleaning machines, ensuring your sofa set looks fresh, hygienic, and comfortable again.</p>								</div>
					</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-ae26e34 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="ae26e34" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
